    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίμῑμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>closely imitating,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠχή,</span> of an echo, <i><span class="en">
				Callistr.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcid.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1406a29
			</span></i>; of man as a microcosm, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς οὐρανίου τάξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Anat.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. οὐρανοῦ ποταμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					9.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.164
			</span></i>, Sthenidasap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				47.63
			</span></i>: c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμὸν ἀ. ἡλίου τροχῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανδραγόρας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.75
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκιμοειδές</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.28
			</span></i>.</div>
